  "description": "Furvaria (FURVARIA) is a furry convention in Bavaria, Germany, organized by Münchner Furs e. V. The first edition, FURVARIA ONE, was held November 14 to 16, 2025, in Marxheim, and the second, FURVARIA 2.0, followed in June 2026 with more outdoor activities and free ice pops and iced tea included in the ticket. Furvaria supports a different local charity each year. The 2026 edition opened a mini arcade hall with cabinets, rhythm games, retro slot machines, a pinball machine and consoles, and a pixel-style character editor let attendees recreate their fursonas.",
